{"id":"m4-081","m":4,"paper":"2017年北京市公务员录用考试《行测》题","region":"北京","year":2017,"q":15,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"2031054","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a2869b45d9b0f3fd.png\" /></p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"8064"},{"k":"B","t":"10077"},{"k":"C","t":"4070302"},{"k":"D","t":"8130527"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9ce14c7a3132b6c4.png\" /></p><p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1466669bf34d8718.png\" /></p><p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-cbce3c78de1a7db2.png\" /></p><p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-aff8c4117c4f55bd.png\" /></p><p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ae92cad70be5998a.png\" /></p><p>故正确答案为B。</p><p>备注：平方差公式：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ef83f54154249fb4.png\" /></p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"2031060","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"小王近期正在减肥，某天他匀速健步走20分钟后，计步器显示他走了3800步，2.5千米，消耗热量150千卡。则为了达到通过健步走消耗600千卡热量的目标，他还得继续走多少步？（假设小王每走一步，消耗的热量保持不变）","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"3800"},{"k":"B","t":"7600"},{"k":"C","t":"11400"},{"k":"D","t":"15200"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>要消耗600千卡热量，已消耗150千卡，则还需消耗450千卡。已知每走一步，消耗热量不变且消耗150千卡需走3800步，所以消耗450千卡需走<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c523101ac2411c96.png\" />步。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":3,"qid":"2031072","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"若将一个长为8厘米、宽为6厘米的长方形盖在一个圆上，两个图形重叠部分的面积占圆的三分之二，占长方形面积的一半。则这个圆的面积为多少平方厘米？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"64"},{"k":"B","t":"24"},{"k":"C","t":"48"},{"k":"D","t":"36"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设重叠部分的面积为2A，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5dc4bb0778439e61.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4d1dfe41dd4751e4.png\" />。已知长方形长为8，宽为6，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bf89a68be9578492.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-34af316aa2e95ded.png\" />。故<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b933fd651dc4f3f5.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":4,"qid":"2031078","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>小张将带领三位专家到当地B单位调研，距离B单位1.44千米处设有地铁站出口。调研工作于上午9点开始，他们需提前10分钟到达B单位，则小张应通知专家最晚几点一起从地铁站出口出发，步行前往B单位？（假设小张和专家的步行速度均为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8bbc2c0195634c2b.png\" />）</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"8点26分"},{"k":"B","t":"8点30分"},{"k":"C","t":"8点36分"},{"k":"D","t":"8点40分"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>调研工作9点开始，需提前10分钟到达即8点50分要到达B单位。已知路程为1.44千米即1440米，速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8bbc2c0195634c2b.png\" />，所以从地铁口到B单位所需时间<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0b382b664e452ee9.png\" />，所以最晚出发时间为8点30分。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":5,"qid":"2031086","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>一台全自动咖啡机打八折销售，利润为进价的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d43716cf36224da5.png\" />，如打七折出售，利润为50元。则这台咖啡机的原价是多少元？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"250"},{"k":"B","t":"240"},{"k":"C","t":"210"},{"k":"D","t":"200"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>赋值咖啡机进价为1。根据条件“打八折销售利润为进价的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d43716cf36224da5.png\" />”，即打八折后的售价为：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c546430879ed0327.png\" />。则原价为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-616123cc08fb95ab.png\" />。若打七折销售，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-daa2f685785f68e0.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ce782a83df6ec99a.png\" />。而实际利润为50元，根据等比放缩，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2b6c2672f95ac8d4.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":6,"qid":"2031090","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>甲、乙和丙共同投资一个项目并约定按投资额分配收益。甲初期投资额占初期总投资额的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d966217474ccbe8a.png\" />，乙的初期投资额是丙的2倍。最终甲获得的收益比丙多2万元。则乙应得的收益为多少万元？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"6"},{"k":"B","t":"7"},{"k":"C","t":"8"},{"k":"D","t":"9"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设丙的投资额为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4ed449be11b64711.png\" />，则乙的投资额为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-eb11dc36ac03e757.png\" />，甲占总投资额的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d966217474ccbe8a.png\" />，故乙加丙占总投资额的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f7503efd18b5bc8f.png\" />，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-deb725271355b22b.png\" />，解得甲的投资额为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-05f3d1b1b335269c.png\" />。按照投资额分配收益，甲的投资额比丙多<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-09178a402f90c447.png\" />，收益多2万元，乙的投资额为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-eb11dc36ac03e757.png\" />，所以收益为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e3bc1c28d6d8b8e2.png\" />万元。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":7,"qid":"2031100","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"张先生比李先生大8岁，张先生的年龄是小王年龄的3倍，9年前李先生的年龄是小王年龄的4倍。则几年后张先生的年龄是小王年龄的2倍？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"10"},{"k":"B","t":"13"},{"k":"C","t":"16"},{"k":"D","t":"19"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意，设李先生今年的年龄为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />，则张、李、王三人今年以及九年前的年龄可得如下：</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/158e8187970dfd8.png\" /></p><p>由“9年前李先生的年龄是小王年龄的4倍”可得，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9ca629b653503495.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e6384479d9676a9a.png\" />。则张今年<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-44d8179b89ddb4be.png\" />岁，王今年<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-de97369404cda137.png\" />岁。当张先生的年龄是小王年龄的2倍时，张先生与小王的年龄差就应该等于小王的年龄，即<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-deac855e05352d2c.png\" />。即小王38岁时，张先生的年龄是小王年龄的2倍。小王今年19岁，38岁时为19年后。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":8,"qid":"2031110","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>某工厂生产甲和乙两种产品，甲产品的日产量是乙产品的1.5倍。现工厂改进了乙产品的生产技术，在保证产量不变的前提下，其单件产品生产能耗降低了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-23d85574dc6adf1c.png\" />，而每日工厂生产甲和乙两种产品的总能耗降低了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f74801b8674b37ff.png\" />。则在改进后，甲、乙两种产品的单件生产能耗之比为？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6af6ed88831d4a12.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e955eadc5b3070ea.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3714533eced0ca89.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bb3e38a39872a676.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>赋值乙日产量为2，则甲的日产量为3，改进后乙单件产品能耗为4，则改进前的能耗为5，设甲单件产品生产能耗为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4ed449be11b64711.png\" />。根据<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-79b472aab2227473.png\" />且总能耗降低<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f74801b8674b37ff.png\" />可得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c6d8269bcc961b52.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c904d06795c9763a.png\" />，故改进后甲、乙单件能耗之比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f572d4425bb1ecc8.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":9,"qid":"2031116","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>小刘早上8点整出发匀速开车从A地前往B地，预计10点整到达。但出发不到1小时后汽车就发生了故障，小刘骑折叠自行车以汽车行驶速度的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ff6fcfdeec885072.png\" />前往A、B两地中点位置的维修站借来工具，并用30分钟修好了汽车，抵达B地时间为11点50分。则小刘汽车发生故障的时间是早上：</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"8点40分"},{"k":"B","t":"8点45分"},{"k":"C","t":"8点50分"},{"k":"D","t":"8点55分"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>假设小刘开车速度为4，那么从A到B共需2个小时，则AB之间路程为8。并且原定时间为2个小时，实际共用了3小时50分钟，多出来的1小时50分钟则为小刘骑车借工具并修车的时间。其中修车30分钟，因此小刘骑车从故障地点到达AB两地中间位置的时间为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c3dcce8fec24968f.png\" />分钟即<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f7503efd18b5bc8f.png\" />小时。由于骑车速度为开车速度的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ff6fcfdeec885072.png\" />，则骑车速度为1，故<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f6a1212d32e71d40.png\" />，因此故障前实际行驶<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5d58376d46913a26.png\" />，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bb4e184339d916cf.png\" />，故发生故障的时间是8点50分。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":10,"qid":"2031118","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>某单位从10名员工中随机选出2人参加培训，选出的2人全为女性的概率正好为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d966217474ccbe8a.png\" />。则如果选出3人参加培训，全为女性的概率在以下哪个范围内？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p>低于<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ee08713ca74cb24b.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ee08713ca74cb24b.png\" />到<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-23d85574dc6adf1c.png\" />之间</p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-23d85574dc6adf1c.png\" />到<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-747b4cf853fa4915.png\" />之间</p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p>高于<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-747b4cf853fa4915.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由于10人中随机选取两名均为女性的概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d966217474ccbe8a.png\" />，因此设女性共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />人，则有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3ebf9556d54eb1aa.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-360ca8fb03270d95.png\" />，于是10人中有6名女性，那么选出3人全为女性的概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-62266e47b0a8939d.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":11,"qid":"2031120","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>某企业共有职工100多人，其中，生产人员与非生产人员的人数之比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3714533eced0ca89.png\" />，而研发与非研发人员的人数之比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1f50126a01cd75a5.png\" />，已知生产人员不能同时担任研发人员，则该企业不在生产和研发两类岗位上的职工有多少人？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"20"},{"k":"B","t":"30"},{"k":"C","t":"24"},{"k":"D","t":"26"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由于生产人员与非生产人员的人数之比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3714533eced0ca89.png\" />，因此总人数为9的倍数，研发与非研发人员的人数之比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1f50126a01cd75a5.png\" />，因此总人数也为8的倍数。因此总人数是8和9的公倍数，因此为72的倍数。又因为总人数在<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9ad3e0df2feafeb6.png\" />之间，因此总人数为144人。那么生产人员为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-64ed75f77ab4b271.png\" />人，研发人员为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b98953bc0054f430.png\" />人。生产人员不能同时担任研发人员，因此非生产与非研发人员数<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e3655ae3cafb052a.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":12,"qid":"2031128","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>某种鸡尾酒的酒精浓度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-23d85574dc6adf1c.png\" />，由<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-493ca4a6edf0f1f4.png\" />种酒、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-261df848778bff30.png\" />种酒和酒精浓度（<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b63b6f4affed9da3.png\" />）<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f74801b8674b37ff.png\" />的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f3a2e3e59d24c286.png\" />种酒按<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8764689da49fd0a2.png\" />的比例（重量比）调制成。已知<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-261df848778bff30.png\" />种酒的酒精浓度是<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-493ca4a6edf0f1f4.png\" />种酒的一半，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-493ca4a6edf0f1f4.png\" />种酒的酒精浓度是：</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-20ad5906bfadbef4.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2f29ab37e5278826.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-343b23ab1648d24a.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9b47a108156a6c82.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>假设鸡尾酒的溶液重量为100，则溶质的量即为20，并且<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-493ca4a6edf0f1f4.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-261df848778bff30.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f3a2e3e59d24c286.png\" />三种酒的质量分别为20、60、20。设<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-493ca4a6edf0f1f4.png\" />种酒的酒精浓度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1160ffc37a9b6750.png\" />，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-261df848778bff30.png\" />为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />，混合后溶质的量不变，则有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0be045617972ede6.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1d7efdd8b075774f.png\" />，于是<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-493ca4a6edf0f1f4.png\" />种酒的酒精浓度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-20ad5906bfadbef4.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":13,"qid":"2031132","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某检修工作由李和王二人负责，两人如一同工作4天，剩下工作量李需要6天，或王需要3天完成。现李和王共同工作了5天，则剩下的工作李单独检修还需几天完成？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"2"},{"k":"B","t":"3"},{"k":"C","t":"4"},{"k":"D","t":"5"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由于剩下的工程李和王的时间比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-17b61176872b4130.png\" />即为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9545a870e15a19a4.png\" />，因此效率比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f4ee0949beae77f9.png\" />。那么设李的效率为1，王的效率为2。<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-56a0512c077fe51d.png\" />。现在二人合作5天后工作量还剩余<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-857bfc5098c0cbcc.png\" />，因此李单独做需要<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-79229b3dd07b1f45.png\" />天。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":14,"qid":"2031140","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>用<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9077a456b7a9bb32.png\" />的方砖铺一个房间的长方形地面，在不破坏方砖的情况下，正好需要用60块方砖。假设该长方形地面的周长的最小值为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4ed449be11b64711.png\" />米，那么X的值在以下哪个范围内？</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-eafd77c5fc55e09b.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3064719f654aa8f4.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2c844e9f93481570.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a70101beb44f3bd1.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>面积一定，两边长度最接近时，长方形周长最小。<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7067024a66d111d2.png\" />按照下图排列为正方形。即一边为2个60厘米、另一边为3个40厘米，一共六块组成一个边长为120厘米的正方形，如图1；九个相同的正方形按三行三列排放组成一个边长为360厘米的正方形，如图2；最终沿着边长将剩余6个，如图3排列组成一个长为400厘米、宽为360厘米的长方形。故最短周长为：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-600cd7b3b58125a5.png\" />。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/158e820f1a89f9a.png\" /><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/158e8216f04349e.png\" /><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/158e82199f37473.png\" /></p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":15,"qid":"2031146","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"从甲地到乙地含首尾两站共有15个公交站，在这些公交站上共有4条公交线路运行。其中，A公交车线路为第1站到第6站，B公交车线路为第3站到第10站，C公交车线路为第7站到第12站，D公交车线路为第10站到第15站。小张要从甲地到乙地，要在这些公交线路中换乘，不在两站之间步行也不往反方向乘坐，每条公交线路只坐一次，则共有多少种不同的换乘方式？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"72"},{"k":"B","t":"64"},{"k":"C","t":"52"},{"k":"D","t":"48"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/158e824c879d226.png\" /><br></p><p>由上图可以看出在第10站时<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-261df848778bff30.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f3a2e3e59d24c286.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-812dbc541d9a2ed5.png\" />三条公交有相同的站点-第十站，故路线可以分为从<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b034aeecf09037ab.png\" />和<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-545a7d09ce8324b5.png\" />这两类情况。</p><p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b034aeecf09037ab.png\" />：第一步从<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f66ee349e2488b18.png\" />，可以在第三、四、五、六换乘，有4种；第二步从<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-70624652ea295931.png\" />，可以在第七、八、九换乘和第十站换乘这两类。第一类在第七、八、九换乘有3种，从<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6f904a0c8e4ec0de.png\" />可以在第十、十一、十二换乘，有3种；第二类在第十站换乘，从<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6f904a0c8e4ec0de.png\" />可以在第十一、十二换乘，有2种。故共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-49adb5fedd5df91f.png\" />种。</p><p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-545a7d09ce8324b5.png\" />：第一步从<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f66ee349e2488b18.png\" />，可以在第三、四、五、六换乘，有4种；第二步从<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1145b54422d85ea2.png\" />，只能在第十站换乘，只有1种情况。故共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7ab5b8b64278bfed.png\" />种，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1dfdf290bf118197.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"}]}]}